&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Software Development Engineer (SDE) to join our growing engineering organization at ID.me. As an early-career engineer, you&#39;ll have the opportunity to contribute to meaningful work across a variety of product and platform teams. Whether it&#39;s building user-facing features, developing APIs, or strengthening the underlying platform, your work will directly impact millions of users. As an Software Development Engineer, you&#39;ll gain experience working with modern technologies and collaborating with experienced engineers to deliver high-quality solutions in line with this strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
