&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Work On&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an intern, you will own a focused set of AI enablement projects, working alongside analytics engineers, data analysts, and data engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
