&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data pipeline automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Use AI-assisted tooling to automate and streamline parts of our data pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detection agents:&lt;/strong&gt; Design agents that monitor data and flag anomalies, quality issues, and unusual patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data architecture and domain-driven design:&lt;/strong&gt; Explore how AI can improve our data models, documentation, and overall architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
