&lt;li&gt;Automate data pipeline tasks such as testing, documentation, and monitoring using AI tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop detection agents that surface data quality problems and anomalies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply domain-driven design principles to help improve data models, metric definitions, and metadata&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with analysts, engineers, and data scientists to understand needs and gather feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document your work and present results and learnings to the team at the end of the internship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
